The bug was introduced by an optimization in the `DocValues` handling (specifically in the singleton optimization) that caused incorrect behavior in range queries for sorted set and sorted numeric doc values. This optimization led to scenarios where the expected values were not correctly retrieved, resulting in potential null pointer exceptions or incorrect query results.

